        Current patterns list (29 entries) covering standard MAS operations:
        agent creation, team creation, deploy, rollback, monitor, test, fix,
        document, audit, migrate, improve, optimize, orchestrate, validate,
        backup, restore, upgrade, list, status, dashboard, signal, health,
